### Test Global Exception Filter
### Test various error scenarios to ensure standardized responses

### 1. Login para obter token
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "123456"
}

###

@token = {{ login.response.body.access_token }}

###

### 2. Validation Error (DTO Validation)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "password": ""
}

###

### 3. Bad Request - Invalid Plot Index
POST http://localhost:3000/farm/unlock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plotIndex": 50
}

###

### 4. Not Found - Non-existent Crop
POST http://localhost:3000/farm/plant
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plotIndex": 0,
  "cropSlug": "non-existent-crop"
}

###

### 5. Bad Request - Insufficient Coins
POST http://localhost:3000/farm/unlock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plotIndex": 10
}

###

### 6. Bad Request - Plot Not Unlocked
POST http://localhost:3000/farm/plant
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plotIndex": 20,
  "cropSlug": "wheat"
}

###

### 7. Unauthorized - No Token
POST http://localhost:3000/farm/unlock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plotIndex": 0
}

###

### Expected Response Format:
{
  "statusCode": 400,
  "error": "Bad Request",
  "message": "Specific error message",
  "timestamp": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "path": "/farm/unlock"
}
